                    <h2>Now Assist AI for IRM</h2>
                    <p>
                        ServiceNow's <strong>Now Assist</strong> embeds generative AI directly into IRM workflows, 
                        reducing manual effort and improving risk decision quality. These AI capabilities are 
                        available in recent releases (Xanadu, Yokohama, and beyond).
                    </p>

                    <h3>AI Capabilities in IRM</h3>
                    <div class="table-responsive">
                        <table class="styled-table">
                            <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th>Capability</th>
                                    <th>What It Does</th>
                                    <th>Business Value</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr>
                                    <td><strong>Risk Summarization</strong></td>
                                    <td>Generates concise summaries of long issue descriptions, audit reports, and risk assessments</td>
                                    <td>Saves 30-40% time for risk managers reviewing records</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td><strong>Risk Identification</strong></td>
                                    <td>AI agents analyze entity context, industry patterns, and internal libraries to suggest potential risks</td>
                                    <td>Discovers risks that manual processes miss</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td><strong>Control Recommendations</strong></td>
                                    <td>Suggests control objectives based on regulatory requirements and existing control framework</td>
                                    <td>Accelerates control design and reduces duplication</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td><strong>De-Duplication</strong></td>
                                    <td>Identifies redundant controls, policies, and risk statements across the organization</td>
                                    <td>Reduces maintenance overhead and improves clarity</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td><strong>Agentic Issue Resolution</strong></td>
                                    <td>AI agents can route issues to appropriate teams, suggest remediation actions, and draft remediation plans</td>
                                    <td>Faster mean time to resolution for compliance issues</td>
                                </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>

                    <div class="info-card info-card--important">
                        <div class="info-card-title">AI Risk Governance</div>
                        <p>
                            ServiceNow IRM also provides capabilities for <strong>governing AI risks</strong> 
                            within your organization. As AI adoption grows, IRM can be used to register AI models 
                            as entities, assess their risks (bias, hallucination, data privacy), and monitor 
                            their compliance with emerging AI regulations (EU AI Act, NIST AI RMF).
                        </p>
                    </div>
